		</div><div id="block-2" class="widget widget_block"></div><div><a href="/privacy-statement/" style="font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 4px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 400; position:relative;">privacy statement</a></div></div>		<div class="container">
			<div class="container_inner default_template_holder clearfix" style='padding-top:0px !important'>
																<div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div id="contact_desktop"    class="vc_row wpb_row section vc_row-fluid " style=' text-align:left;'><div class=" full_section_inner clearfix"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 vc_hidden-sm vc_hidden-xs"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="gambit_fullheight_row" data-content-location="center" style="display: none"></div><div     class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner section vc_row-fluid" style=' text-align:left;'><div class=" full_section_inner clearfix"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-5"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3>Contact</h3>

		</div> 
	</div> <div class="vc_empty_space"   style="height: 20px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>We are always happy to hear from you and would love to connect! If you have a question that hasn’t been answered yet, please feel free to get in touch with us using the enquiry form.</p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><span style="color: #ffffff;">t</span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">You are welcome to visit BioArt Village. Visits are by appointment, so please get in touch with us beforehand to arrange your visit and ensure access to the site.</p>
<p><span style="color: #ffffff;">t </span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Address:</strong> Oirschotsedijk 14-10, Eindhoven.</p>
<p><span style="color: #ffffff;">t </span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">There is ample parking available at our location. Coming by public transport? BioArt Village is approximately a 35-minute walk from Eindhoven Strijp-S train station. Alternatively, you can take bus 10 (bus stop: De Schakel/Truckstop 8 &#8211; 15 minute walk) or bus 8  (bus stop: Leo van Dorstpad &#8211; 18 minute walk). You can view the Google Map below.</p>

		</div> 
